# Research outputs: reports (*.md), run metadata (*.json) and small summary CSVs are tracked;
# bulky per-trade data, chunk parts and run logs are not.
# (research/data and research/.venv are already covered by data/ and .venv/)
!research/results/**/*.csv
research/results/**/parts/
research/results/**/*.gz
research/results/**/*.log
research/results/**/*trades*.csv
research/results/**/control.csv
